# This file is a sample of the individuals generated by mappings/mapping_final.rml.
# All values come from the with-labels CSVs.
#
# The sample reflects the mapping output exactly:
#   - subject IRIs built with rr:template are percent-encoded by RMLMapper
#     (for example, Chamber%C3%AD or Ciudad%20Lineal);
#   - facilities have a single rdfs:label, taken from the OpenRefine Label column;
#   - every entity has an owl:sameAs link. Districts, neighborhoods and parks
#     use their own Wikidata entity; fountains and benches use the entity of
#     their neighborhood, and toilets use the entity of their district,
#     because the source has no Wikidata entity for those facilities.

